  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Better Health in Bangladesh &#x2013; Technical Assistance through UN agencies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen health systems by providing technical assistance to the Government of Bangladesh through UNFPA and WHO. The focus of the project is to increase demand for and utilisation of sexual and reproductive health and rights services. Key activities are maternal health interventions, family planning services and cervical cancer screening and treatment, and strengthening midwifery profession in Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
